					@ A little character, from p 2-39 of HP50G advanced reference
					@ This tests the compatibility for GROB format
					grob 9 15 E300140015001C001400E3008000C110AA00940090004100220014102800
					→ Walk
					«
						ClearLCD
						{ 16#0 16#40 } GraphicPicture
						Over Walk GraphicXor
						1 99999
						for i
							i 420 mod RealToBinary
							16#40 2 →List
							GraphicPicture
							Over Walk GraphicXor
							GraphicPicture
							Rot Walk GraphicXor
							@ Set flag 48 for HP-48-style slow walk
							if
								48 TestFlagSet
							then
								0.200 Wait 5
							else
								1.00E-2 Wait 1
							end
						step
					»
				»
			Lines
				«
					@ Helper program to draw a line at index i
					«
						10 6
						→ i XSize YSize
						«
							@ Build starting point
							{ }
							@ X coordinate
							i sin XSize ×
							+
							@ Y coordinate
							i 2.17 × cos YSize
							× +
							@ Build end point
							{ }
							@ X coordinate
							i 2.30 × sin XSize
							× +
							@ Y coordinate
							i 2.61500 × cos
							YSize × +
							@ Draw the line and wait for 1ms
							DrawLine
						»
					»
					→ MyLine
					«
						Degrees ClearLCD
						0 360000
						for i
							@ Erase old line
							1 10
							for g
								g 10 ÷ GrayPattern
								Foreground i 100
								g + - MyLine
							next
							@ Set random foreground and draw new line
							if
								Ticks 1000 ÷
								10 mod 7 <
							then
								16#0 Foreground
							else
								16#1111111111111111
								i 16 mod × Foreground
							end i MyLine
							@ Wait 1ms
							1.00E-3 Wait
						next
					»
				»
